<title>CANADA: CWB details top malt barley markets in 1995/96.</title>
<headline>CWB details top malt barley markets in 1995/96.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board on Wednesday detailed its top five markets for malt barley in crop year 1995/96 (Aug/July).</p>
<p>TOP FIVE MALT BARLEY MARKETS</p>
<p>Country	 Tonnage</p>
<p>Canada	  1,200,000 tonnes</p>
<p>United States   927,000 tonnes</p>
<p>China	     379,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Colombia	  146,000 tonnes</p>
<p>Japan		83,000 tonnes</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
